OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to sell unused sports
OL,4,Aground after 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey local authority has agreed to
OL,7,Fsell a sports ground 10 years after
OL,8,F52,000 tons of soil were mistakenly
OL,9,Fdumped there, rendering it unusable.
OL,11,FFormer home to the Elmbridge Eagles
OL,12,FRugby Club, the Oaken Lane site in
OL,13,FClaygate has not been utilised since
OL,14,F2016, after double the 26,000 tonnes
OL,15,Fintended for pitch improvement works
OL,16,Fwere dropped off in error.
OL,18,FHowever, Elmbridge Borough Council
OL,19,F(EBC) announced on Thursday that its
OL,20,Fcabinet had now agreed to "market the
OL,21,Fsite for recreational and leisure use".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
